/Write a program to display the values from 1 to 10.
Loop,   Load Value
        Output
        Jns Check       /value - 10，如果等于0，说明是10。如果小于0，说明没到10.只要大于0，说明10到了
        Load Value
        Add One
        Store Value
        Jump Loop

OutputZero,     Output
End,            Halt

Check,  Dec 0
        Load Value
        Subt Ten
        SkipCond 000    /ac < 0, 不 end
        Jump End
        JumpI Check
Value,     dec 1
One,       dec 1
Ten,       dec 10